  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: JessiLoreDump
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'the player decides she''s prying into jessi''s brain as much as
    she can. might as well find out how the clock ticks before buying it.


    she
    tells jessi that she can see jessi trying to feel better about herself, and it''s
    really not doing her any favors. why reject the facts when you can just face
    them?


    jessi lies and says that she''s not trying to spare her own feelings;
    it''s really not that bad!!! but the player immediately shuts her down by telling
    her to cut the crap. it''s so obvious that it''s laughable, so stop trying.


    jessi
    angrily gives up and admits that Fine, she is just trying to feel better about
    herself. the hell is wrong with that? player argues that EVERYTHING is wrong
    with that. there''s no merit to trying to run away from the truth; it just leads
    to more shortcomings.


'
